---
interface Props {
  vertical: "repair_shop" | "dealer" | "beauty_salon";
  backHref: string;
  backLabel: string;
}
const { vertical, backHref, backLabel } = Astro.props;
---

<main class:list={["business-social-page", vertical === "repair_shop" && "company-page"]} data-business-social data-vertical={vertical}>
  <div class="social-shell">
    <a class="back-link" href={backHref}>← {backLabel}</a>
    <header class="social-hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Hermes Connect · Social Media</p>
        <h1>Social Media</h1>
        <p class="lead">Connect the business-owned Facebook Page, Instagram Professional account and Threads profile through provider OAuth. Tokens stay encrypted server-side and no account is marked connected until provider readback succeeds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="truth-card">
        <strong data-business-name>Loading business…</strong>
        <span data-business-type>Owner workspace</span>
        <small>Facebook · Instagram · Threads</small>
      </div>
    </header>

    <p class="notice" data-social-status role="status">Checking connection state…</p>

    <section class="provider-grid" aria-label="Social network connections">
      <article class="provider-card" data-provider-card="facebook">
        <div class="provider-head">
          <div><small>Meta</small><h2>Facebook</h2></div>
          <span class="state" data-provider-state>Loading…</span>
        </div>
        <p data-provider-account>Not connected</p>
        <div class="candidate-wrap hidden" data-candidate-wrap>
          <label>Choose Page<select data-candidate-select></select></label>
          <button type="button" class="secondary" data-select-account>Use this Page</button>
        </div>
        <div class="actions">
          <button type="button" data-connect-provider>Connect / reconnect</button>
          <button type="button" class="secondary hidden" data-disconnect-provider>Disconnect</button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="provider-card" data-provider-card="instagram">
        <div class="provider-head">
          <div><small>Meta</small><h2>Instagram</h2></div>
          <span class="state" data-provider-state>Loading…</span>
        </div>
        <p data-provider-account>Not connected</p>
        <div class="candidate-wrap hidden" data-candidate-wrap>
          <label>Choose Instagram account<select data-candidate-select></select></label>
          <button type="button" class="secondary" data-select-account>Use this account</button>
        </div>
        <div class="actions">
          <button type="button" data-connect-provider>Connect / reconnect</button>
          <button type="button" class="secondary hidden" data-disconnect-provider>Disconnect</button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="provider-card" data-provider-card="threads">
        <div class="provider-head">
          <div><small>Meta</small><h2>Threads</h2></div>
          <span class="state" data-provider-state>Loading…</span>
        </div>
        <p data-provider-account>Not connected</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <button type="button" data-connect-provider>Connect / reconnect</button>
          <button type="button" class="secondary hidden" data-disconnect-provider>Disconnect</button>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="publish-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Owner-approved publishing</p>
          <h2>Create and publish</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Manual publishing is available only for a verified connection. Recurring scheduling stays in the canonical Hermes Social Publisher; this CRM does not create a second scheduler.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="publisher-grid">
        <form class="publisher-card" data-publish-form="threads">
          <div><small>Threads</small><h3>Text post</h3></div>
          <label>Post text<textarea name="text" rows="6" maxlength="500" placeholder="Write a platform-native Threads post."></textarea></label>
          <button type="submit" disabled>Publish to Threads</button>
          <p data-publish-result></p>
        </form>

        <form class="publisher-card" data-publish-form="instagram">
          <div><small>Instagram</small><h3>Carousel</h3></div>
          <label>Caption<textarea name="caption" rows="4" maxlength="2200" placeholder="Carousel caption"></textarea></label>
          <label>Image URLs <span>2–10 HTTPS images, one per line</span><textarea name="image_urls" rows="6" placeholder="https://…/slide-1.jpg&#10;https://…/slide-2.jpg"></textarea></label>
          <button type="submit" disabled>Publish carousel</button>
          <p data-publish-result></p>
        </form>

        <form class="publisher-card" data-publish-form="facebook">
          <div><small>Facebook Page</small><h3>Page post</h3></div>
          <label>Post text<textarea name="text" rows="6" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Write the Facebook Page post."></textarea></label>
          <button type="submit" disabled>Publish to Facebook</button>
          <p data-publish-result></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="safety-note">
      <strong>Connection boundary</strong>
      <p>Saving a public profile URL is not a connection. A network becomes connected only after owner OAuth, provider account readback and encrypted token persistence. Provider failures fail closed and an idempotency key prevents accidental duplicate publishing.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>

<script is:inline define:vars={{ vertical }}>
(() => {
  const root = document.querySelector("[data-business-social]");
  if (!(root instanceof HTMLElement)) return;
  const status = root.querySelector("[data-social-status]");
  const cards = new Map(
    [...root.querySelectorAll("[data-provider-card]")].map((node) => [node.getAttribute("data-provider-card"), node])
  );
  const forms = new Map(
    [...root.querySelectorAll("[data-publish-form]")].map((node) => [node.getAttribute("data-publish-form"), node])
  );

  const showStatus = (message, error = false) => {
    if (!status) return;
    status.textContent = message;
    status.toggleAttribute("data-error", error);
  };

  const request = async (url, options = {}) => {
    const response = await fetch(url, {
      credentials: "same-origin",
      cache: "no-store",
      ...options,
      headers: { Accept: "application/json", "Content-Type": "application/json", ...(options.headers || {}) },
    });
    const payload = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));
    if (!response.ok) {
      const error = new Error(payload.error || `request_${response.status}`);
      error.payload = payload;
      throw error;
    }
    return payload;
  };

  const setPublisherEnabled = (provider, enabled) => {
    const form = forms.get(provider);
    const button = form?.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
    if (button instanceof HTMLButtonElement) button.disabled = !enabled;
  };

  const renderConnection = (connection) => {
    const provider = connection?.provider;
    const card = cards.get(provider);
    if (!(card instanceof HTMLElement)) return;
    const state = card.querySelector("[data-provider-state]");
    const account = card.querySelector("[data-provider-account]");
    const connect = card.querySelector("[data-connect-provider]");
    const disconnect = card.querySelector("[data-disconnect-provider]");
    const candidateWrap = card.querySelector("[data-candidate-wrap]");
    const candidateSelect = card.querySelector("[data-candidate-select]");

    const stateValue = String(connection?.state || "ready_for_owner_auth");
    if (state) state.textContent = stateValue.replaceAll("_", " ");
    const accountLabel = connection?.username
      ? `@${connection.username}`
      : connection?.account_name || (stateValue === "connected_write" ? "Connected account" : "Not connected");
    if (account) account.textContent = accountLabel;

    if (connect instanceof HTMLButtonElement) {
      connect.disabled = !connection?.configured;
      connect.textContent = stateValue === "connected_write" ? "Reconnect" : connection?.configured ? "Connect" : "Needs provider app config";
    }
    if (disconnect instanceof HTMLElement) disconnect.classList.toggle("hidden", stateValue !== "connected_write");

    const candidates = Array.isArray(connection?.candidates) ? connection.candidates : [];
    if (candidateWrap instanceof HTMLElement) candidateWrap.classList.toggle("hidden", stateValue !== "selection_required" || candidates.length === 0);
    if (candidateSelect instanceof HTMLSelectElement) {
      candidateSelect.replaceChildren();
      for (const candidate of candidates) {
        const option = document.createElement("option");
        option.value = String(candidate.index);
        option.textContent = String(candidate.label || "Account");
        candidateSelect.append(option);
      }
    }
    setPublisherEnabled(provider, stateValue === "connected_write");
  };

  const load = async () => {
    try {
      const payload = await request(`/api/hermes-connect/social/connections?vertical=${encodeURIComponent(vertical)}`);
      const businessName = root.querySelector("[data-business-name]");
      const businessType = root.querySelector("[data-business-type]");
      if (businessName) businessName.textContent = payload.business?.name || "Business";
      if (businessType) businessType.textContent = String(payload.business?.vertical || vertical).replaceAll("_", " ");
      for (const connection of payload.connections || []) renderConnection(connection);
      showStatus("Social connections are ready. Connect only the accounts owned by this business.");
    } catch (error) {
      showStatus(error?.message === "authentication_required" ? "Sign in to the owner CRM first." : "Unable to load social connections.", true);
    }
  };

  for (const [provider, card] of cards) {
    if (!(card instanceof HTMLElement)) continue;
    card.querySelector("[data-connect-provider]")?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
      try {
        showStatus(`Preparing ${provider} authorization…`);
        const payload = await request("/api/hermes-connect/social/oauth/start", {
          method: "POST",
          body: JSON.stringify({ provider, vertical }),
        });
        window.location.assign(payload.authorization_url);
      } catch (error) {
        showStatus(`${provider}: ${error.message}`, true);
      }
    });

    card.querySelector("[data-select-account]")?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
      const select = card.querySelector("[data-candidate-select]");
      if (!(select instanceof HTMLSelectElement)) return;
      try {
        const payload = await request("/api/hermes-connect/social/select", {
          method: "POST",
          body: JSON.stringify({ provider, vertical, candidate_index: Number(select.value) }),
        });
        for (const connection of payload.connections || []) renderConnection(connection);
        showStatus(`${provider} account connected.`);
      } catch (error) {
        showStatus(`${provider}: ${error.message}`, true);
      }
    });

    card.querySelector("[data-disconnect-provider]")?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
      if (!window.confirm(`Disconnect the Hermes-side ${provider} authorization for this business?`)) return;
      try {
        const payload = await request("/api/hermes-connect/social/disconnect", {
          method: "POST",
          body: JSON.stringify({ provider, vertical, confirm: true }),
        });
        for (const connection of payload.connections || []) renderConnection(connection);
        showStatus(`${provider} disconnected locally. Revoke provider access in Meta separately if required.`);
      } catch (error) {
        showStatus(`${provider}: ${error.message}`, true);
      }
    });
  }

  for (const [provider, form] of forms) {
    if (!(form instanceof HTMLFormElement)) continue;
    form.addEventListener("submit", async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (!window.confirm(`Publish this approved ${provider} content now?`)) return;
      const result = form.querySelector("[data-publish-result]");
      const button = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
      if (button instanceof HTMLButtonElement) button.disabled = true;
      if (result) result.textContent = "Publishing…";
      const idempotency = `hc-${provider}-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8)}`;
      const body = { provider, vertical, idempotency_key: idempotency };
      if (provider === "instagram") {
        body.caption = form.elements.namedItem("caption")?.value || "";
        body.image_urls = String(form.elements.namedItem("image_urls")?.value || "").split(/\r?\n/).map((item) => item.trim()).filter(Boolean);
      } else {
        body.text = form.elements.namedItem("text")?.value || "";
      }
      try {
        const payload = await request("/api/hermes-connect/social/publish", { method: "POST", body: JSON.stringify(body) });
        const publication = payload.publication || {};
        if (result) {
          result.replaceChildren();
          const text = document.createElement("span");
          text.textContent = publication.status || "Published";
          result.append(text);
          if (publication.permalink) {
            const link = document.createElement("a");
            link.href = publication.permalink;
            link.target = "_blank";
            link.rel = "noopener noreferrer";
            link.textContent = " Open post";
            result.append(link);
          }
        }
      } catch (error) {
        if (result) result.textContent = error?.payload?.publication?.status || error.message || "Publish failed";
      } finally {
        if (button instanceof HTMLButtonElement) button.disabled = false;
      }
    });
  }

  const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
  const oauthResult = params.get("result");
  if (oauthResult) {
    showStatus(oauthResult === "connected" ? "Provider authorization completed." : `Provider authorization: ${oauthResult.replaceAll("_", " ")}`, oauthResult !== "connected" && oauthResult !== "selection_required");
  }
  void load();
})();
</script>

<style>
  .business-social-page{min-height:100vh;background:#f4f6f8;color:#172033;padding:7.5rem 0 4rem}
  .social-shell{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:0 auto}
  .back-link{display:inline-flex;margin-bottom:1.2rem;color:#526174;text-decoration:none;font-weight:760}
  .social-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr .7fr;gap:1.5rem;align-items:end;padding:2rem;border:1px solid #e1e6ed;border-radius:22px;background:#fff}
  .eyebrow{margin:0 0 .45rem;color:#69768a;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:850;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
  .social-hero h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,5rem);line-height:.95}
  .lead{max-width:760px;margin:1rem 0 0;color:#617083;line-height:1.65}
  .truth-card{display:grid;gap:.35rem;padding:1.2rem;border-radius:16px;background:#172033;color:#fff}.truth-card span,.truth-card small{color:#c7d0dd}
  .notice{margin:1rem 0;padding:.85rem 1rem;border:1px solid #cfe4d5;border-radius:12px;background:#f0f9f3;color:#285f3b}.notice[data-error]{border-color:#f0cbd1;background:#fff3f4;color:#8d2f40}
  .provider-grid,.publisher-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}
  .provider-card,.publisher-card,.safety-note{padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid #e1e6ed;border-radius:16px;background:#fff}
  .provider-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem}.provider-head h2,.publisher-card h3{margin:.2rem 0 0}.provider-head small,.publisher-card small{color:#7a8698;font-weight:800}
  .state{padding:.35rem .55rem;border-radius:999px;background:#eef2f7;color:#556274;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:850}
  .actions{display:flex;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1rem}
  button{border:1px solid #172033;border-radius:10px;background:#172033;color:#fff;padding:.72rem .9rem;font:inherit;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}button.secondary{background:#fff;color:#172033;border-color:#d5dce5}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
  .hidden{display:none!important}.candidate-wrap{display:grid;gap:.65rem;padding:.8rem;margin-top:.8rem;border-radius:12px;background:#f6f8fb}
  label{display:grid;gap:.4rem;font-weight:760}label span{font-size:.75rem;color:#7b8798;font-weight:650}
  select,textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid #ccd5e0;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;padding:.72rem;font:inherit;color:#172033}
  .publish-section{margin-top:2rem}.section-heading{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.section-heading h2{margin:.2rem 0 0;font-size:2rem}.section-heading>p{max-width:620px;color:#667487;line-height:1.55}
  .publisher-card{display:grid;gap:1rem}.publisher-card p{min-height:1.25rem;margin:0;color:#536276;font-size:.84rem}.publisher-card p a{color:#1268c4}
  .safety-note{margin-top:1rem}.safety-note p{margin:.35rem 0 0;color:#667487;line-height:1.55}
  @media(max-width:900px){.social-hero,.provider-grid,.publisher-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section-heading{display:grid;gap:.4rem}.business-social-page{padding-top:6.5rem}}
</style>
